    "name": "Distant Oceanic Getaway",
    "steam_appid": 2861290,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861290/extras/e12e10f89d19a8058e89477f69a8444e.webp?t=1750148754\" width=209 height=60 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861290/extras/98cc39b669c22db5fb3556b90ded0229.avif?t=1750148754\" width=616 height=259 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Distant Oceanic Getaway - A visual novel for sapphics!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cruise ship\u2019s horns blast. You\u2019re going to be spending the next 10 days aboard the Distant Oceanic Cruise, a luxury vacation for sapphics only! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Maeve (customizable name), a heartbroken soul determined to move on from a cheating ex. There are only seven other single sapphics on board\u2014 could one possibly be your soulmate? Only time will tell! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After all, \u2018tis the SEA-son for love!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861290/extras/e6671825f174e6bf96a73245b5099103.poster.avif?t=1750148754\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861290/extras/e6671825f174e6bf96a73245b5099103.webm?t=1750148754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861290/extras/e6671825f174e6bf96a73245b5099103.mp4?t=1750148754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861290/extras/7dea7e7887cbb479adc44e074f839e53.webp?t=1750148754\" width=209 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll have 10 days aboard the ship to explore, interact with characters, and have fun. Get drunk at the bar and pass out after having three drinks! Contemplate the meaning of life with a stranger you just met! There are endless choices for you to make and infinite opportunities for you to explore! And\u2026 perhaps even a secret hidden storyline for you to uncover?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861290/extras/b212fa4cf18a5a5e0b7c015ed3a98ea6.poster.avif?t=1750148754\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861290/extras/b212fa4cf18a5a5e0b7c015ed3a98ea6.webm?t=1750148754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861290/extras/b212fa4cf18a5a5e0b7c015ed3a98ea6.mp4?t=1750148754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices will shape your experience aboard the cruise. What kind of person will you be? Who will you fall in love with? Which ship will set sail? And where will you end up after these fateful 10 days\u2026?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861290/extras/b53ba19b2df0de055011dc889bb921f6.avif?t=1750148754\" width=293 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861290/extras/8d5501719a71e0bf76568cbc3888ff78.avif?t=1750148754\" width=616 height=1115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices That Matter:</strong> Experience over 30 unique endings based on your character\u2019s decisions! Endless gameplay! Infinite replayability!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization Options:</strong> Your name and pronouns are customizable! There will also be two different voice options for Maeve: a feminine one and a gender-neutral one.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Original Art\u2014 Live2D Sprites and Gorgeous Illustrations:</strong> Become fully immersed in visuals that bring the story to life. You\u2019ll feel like you\u2019re literally aboard the Distant Oceanic Cruise!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861290/extras/9ddb0517c5131eb6436963182ffb435c.poster.avif?t=1750148754\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861290/extras/9ddb0517c5131eb6436963182ffb435c.webm?t=1750148754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861290/extras/9ddb0517c5131eb6436963182ffb435c.mp4?t=1750148754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861290/extras/f55103b506141e39aa3557023a6815c5.webp?t=1750148754\" width=209 height=60 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Script, Program: Ziny</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art: \u6e05\u5ddd\u8001\u9f20</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UI &amp; background: \u6625\u5c71</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live2D: \u732b\u53e3\u888b\u3001Ziny</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music: \u786f\u58f9</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Localization: Bobbu (English) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proofreaders: \u7d2b\u840d\u4e1c\u90ed\uff08\u7c21\uff09,\u9673\u851a\u5d50\uff08\u7e41\uff09</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PV:\u00a0JY\u89e3\u6120 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special thanks to:\u00a0\u56f0\u751f, Pain-Jam-Cookie</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861290/extras/e12e10f89d19a8058e89477f69a8444e.webp?t=1750148754\" width=209 height=60 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861290/extras/98cc39b669c22db5fb3556b90ded0229.avif?t=1750148754\" width=616 height=259 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Distant Oceanic Getaway - A visual novel for sapphics!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cruise ship\u2019s horns blast. You\u2019re going to be spending the next 10 days aboard the Distant Oceanic Cruise, a luxury vacation for sapphics only! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Maeve (customizable name), a heartbroken soul determined to move on from a cheating ex. There are only seven other single sapphics on board\u2014 could one possibly be your soulmate? Only time will tell! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After all, \u2018tis the SEA-son for love!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861290/extras/e6671825f174e6bf96a73245b5099103.poster.avif?t=1750148754\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861290/extras/e6671825f174e6bf96a73245b5099103.webm?t=1750148754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861290/extras/e6671825f174e6bf96a73245b5099103.mp4?t=1750148754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861290/extras/7dea7e7887cbb479adc44e074f83