r:</strong> Experience over 30 unique endings based on your character\u2019s decisions! Endless gameplay! Infinite replayability!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization Options:</strong> Your name and pronouns are customizable! There will also be two different voice options for Maeve: a feminine one and a gender-neutral one.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Original Art\u2014 Live2D Sprites and Gorgeous Illustrations:</strong> Become fully immersed in visuals that bring the story to life. You\u2019ll feel like you\u2019re literally aboard the Distant Oceanic Cruise!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861290/extras/9ddb0517c5131eb6436963182ffb435c.poster.avif?t=1750148754\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861290/extras/9ddb0517c5131eb6436963182ffb435c.webm?t=1750148754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861290/extras/9ddb0517c5131eb6436963182ffb435c.mp4?t=1750148754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861290/extras/f55103b506141e39aa3557023a6815c5.webp?t=1750148754\" width=209 height=60 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Script, Program: Ziny</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Art: \u6e05\u5ddd\u8001\u9f20</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UI &amp; background: \u6625\u5c71</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live2D: \u732b\u53e3\u888b\u3001Ziny</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music: \u786f\u58f9</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Localization: Bobbu (English) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proofreade